comment.narrative:
1.Institutional capacity building gaps and action plans to fill the gaps prepared for 8 : Agriculture, Forestry, Transport, Electric Power, Industry, Mining, Urban development, and Housing sectors to integrate current and future climate change adaptation and mitigation measures in their respective Development Plans;
2. Awareness raising workshop organized on NDC/ NAP and 300 stake holders sensitized on the subject 
3Finance Strategy for the implementation of the updated NDC validated by the government ; NGOs and Development 
Partners;
4.With the support of the project, Ethiopia submitted its revised NDC for UNFCCC by July 23/2021. The Revised NDC is integrated in the Ten Years Development Plan of the country

1The consultant recruitment for the establishment of Platform for NDC sectors finalized and the work is on progress;
2.In collaboration with other development partners the required support provided for updating Ethiopias NDC. The UNDP recruited Project Manager for DEEP Dive is chairing the expert group established for the updating of Ethiopias NDC. Serious workshops and meetings financed by the project. Ethiopia submitted its revised NDC for UNFCCC by July 2020
3.Recruitment of International Consultant for the development Partnership Plan for updated NDC is under evaluation
